      "id": "ENF-08-DD-001",
      "decision": "Enforcement Rule 领域拥有流程与时限规则，Calendar/Legal Knowledge 提供版本资源，Agent 仅编排解释。",
      "basis": "ARC-03",
      "changesBusinessMeaning": false
